#
#	
#	Issue
#	On RHEL7.3 GA systems with ipv6 disabled, rpcbind fails to start.
#	#systemctl status rpcbind.socket shows error Failed to listen on RPCbind Server Activation Socket.
#	Resolution
#	Rebuild the initramfs: # dracut -v -f to incorporate the changes made to /etc/sysctl.conf
#	It is necessary to rebuild the initramfs when ever there are modifications made to /etc/sysctl.conf.
#	Following the rebuild of the initramfs please reboot the system in order for the systemd response to take effect.
#	For additional reading please read When is it necessary to rebuild the initramfs?
#	

#
#	Follow is what I did to fix this bitch.
#
